      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Four stacked rectangles, top to bottom:\n  1. Fedora (muted box) \u2014 upstream\n  2. RHEL / UBI (plain box) \u2014 stable base\n  3. Project Hummingbird (red-accent box) \u2014 minimal runtime\n  4. OpenShift / Kubernetes (plain box) \u2014 platform\n\nDown-arrows between each pair. Caption underneath:\n\"Each layer is built from the one above.\"\n",
